"""Module 3 research records (version 2): decision-authority rules, 2019/2025 comparison with change attribution,
intervening-instruction chronology, and the evidence/uncertainty register.

Vocabularies
------------
modality         mandatory | conditional | permitted_discretion | bounded_discretion | automated | not_provided | unspecified
v1_status        verified | qualified | corrected | new          (status of the version-1 record after the audit)
attribution      baseline_2019 | predates_2019 | continuity | introduced_between_2019_2025 | first_documented_2025 |
                 changed_twice | origin_unknown
evidence_grade   A primary text read (official host, or byte/text-identical signed mirrors)
                 B official government summary (La Moncloa / Consejo de Ministros press)
                 C secondary source quoting or summarising the instruction (press, police academy)
                 D inference from absence in the available sources
"""
from __future__ import annotations


